  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>本模組僅為測試版。</strong></span></h1>\n<p>由 Orca-san 開發的「Jujutsu Craft」擴充模組，提供與「Epic Fight」戰鬥系統的完整相容性。靈感來自史上最佳 mikku500。</p>\n<p><span>此模組透過為咒具加入適當的武器能力、自訂攻擊風格與格擋機制，無縫整合了這兩個系統</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。同時包含全面的高階生物補丁，確保 Jujutsu Craft 的實體與首領能在 Epic Fight 引擎中正確進行戰鬥與動畫播放</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>此外，此擴充模組為遊戲加入了自訂視覺增強功能，包括「Hollow Wicker Basket」的 3D 模型</span><span><sup></sup></span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<h2><strong><span><span>需求：</span></span></strong></h2>\n<p><span><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sorceryfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Craft (Sourcery Fight)</a>&nbsp;by Orca_san_</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight</span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>奇蹟武器</span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-impactful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight - Impactful</span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-indestructible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>Epic Fight - Indestructible</span></span></a></p>\n<h1><span><span><strong>請回報任何錯誤。</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span><span><strong>若有改進建議，歡迎留言。</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p><span><span><strong>更多我的模組：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-better-random\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Better Random</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jujutsu-better-menu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Better Menu</a></p>\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jjk-hub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jujutsu Hub</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
